### Login válido
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"aluno","senha":"Aluno123!"}

### Execute duas vezes para bloquear aluno
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"aluno","senha":"errada"}

### Desbloquear (somente administrador)
PUT http://localhost:8080/unlock/aluno
Authorization: Basic admin Admin123!

### Cadastrar (somente manutenção)
POST http://localhost:8080/
Authorization: Basic manutencao Manut123!
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"novo","senha":"Nova123!"}

### Listar sem expor senhas
GET http://localhost:8080/
Authorization: Basic manutencao Manut123!

### Troca pública, exige senha atual válida
PUT http://localhost:8080/trocarsenha/novo
Content-Type: application/json

{"atual":"Nova123!","nova":"Outra123!"}
